{"about_the_game":"<br><br>Expedition Zero \u2014 survival horror set in the anomaly zone of the northern forest. <br>Face the dreadful forest monster and find a way to defeat it. <br><br>Explore the corrupted forest and abandoned research facilities to uncover the truth about the top-secret expedition. <br>Limited resources can be used to enhance your abilities and chances of survival in extreme conditions. <br>Could you escape the zone or reveal the secrets it keeps? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247570/extras/a92181a050079509518d3a9439888fcf.poster.avif?t=1727198856\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247570/extras/a92181a050079509518d3a9439888fcf.webm?t=1727198856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247570/extras/a92181a050079509518d3a9439888fcf.mp4?t=1727198856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key Features:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight or Hide</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247570/extras/5112394b20a920c76676b5d745ea42be.poster.avif?t=1727198856\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247570/extras/5112394b20a920c76676b5d745ea42be.webm?t=1727198856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247570/extras/5112394b20a920c76676b5d745ea42be.mp4?t=1727198856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are not alone in the forest. <br>Face the horrifying monster in a deadly duel. <br>How would you deal with other corrupted creatures? <br>Run away, fight back or become prey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive </h2><s